						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Tuesday, January 21, 2003</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Email Service </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Our ISP is imposing a limit on the number Email address we have from unlimited to five.<BR><BR>We're currently exploring alternate options to provide @solusekro.com email addresses. If we don't have a new solution in place by monday your Email accounts will be unaccessable.<BR><BR>I would recomend cleaning out your mail boxes now. When we move the mail accounts we won't be able to move any messages currently being stored on the mail server.<BR><BR><BR>
							<br><BR>
							 - Ganza<BR><BR>
							</p>
